## [0.2.0] - 2026-08-13

### Refined
- Organized final project directory structure (`/css`, `/images`, `/js`).
- Cleaned up code layout and verified Apache shared hosting compatibility for deployment.
- Finalized base HTML/CSS build in preparation for milestone submissions.

---

## [0.1.0] - 2026-07-28

### Added
- Initialized repository structure and created root project directory.
- Created basic HTML starter templates for core pages (`index.html`, `about.html`, `services.html`, `enquiry.html`, `contactus.html`).
- Configured default HTML metadata, viewport settings, and standard semantic page shells (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`, `<section>`).